    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, a professional can't really help with a hardware issue, right? like, if the code is fundamentally broken, how do you fix it? i just keep thinking about how quiet and still everything would be if the process just stopped. no more noise, no more feeling like i'm just trying to render in a world that doesn't have a place for me. wouldn't that be a cleaner way to just... exit the simulation?",
